    "detailed_description": "Your objective is to tackle a wide range of tasks, from grocery shopping and getting the mail to packing for a trip and finishing school. <br />\r\nDive into the turbulent lives of four college roommates as you race through busy shops, crowded streets, and level-after-level of action-packed fun! Plan out your day, coordinate pickups and drop-offs, and strategize efficient routes to complete your tasks and beat the clock.<br />\r\nAssemble your Errand Task Force and add \u201cGame Night\u201d to your to-do list today!",
